{"sha": "779604e3be75dc44f925288a0f11f37ad9cbaa4cfa3fdfb4b159ec12f250d6c0", "body": ["\\chapter{立体图形与体积}\\label{ch:g9:solids}", "", "立体几何从一组基本的立体图形开始——棱柱、", "圆柱、棱锥、圆锥、球——并提出两个问题：它们的体积有多大，", "切开它们时看到的是怎样的截面？", "本章最后给出一个非常实用的结论：把一个", "立体图形按比例 $k$ 缩放，体积就变为原来的 $k^3$ 倍。", "", "\\section{经典立体图形及其体积}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[体积公式]\\label{thm:g9:solids:volumes}", "记底面积为 $B$，高为 $h$（即", "底面与对面或顶点之间的距离）。", "\\begin{center}", "\\renewcommand{\\arraystretch}{1.5}", "\\begin{tabular}{l|l}", "立体图形 & 体积 \\\\", "\\hline", "棱柱、圆柱 & $V = B \\times h$ \\\\[5pt]", "棱锥、圆锥 & $V = \\dfrac13\\, B \\times h$ \\\\[5pt]", "半径为 $r$ 的球 & $V = \\dfrac43\\,\\pi r^3$ \\\\", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "对于半径为 $r$ 的圆柱和圆锥，底面积为 $B = \\pi r^2$；", "球的表面积为 $4\\pi r^2$。", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  % cylinder", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) ellipse (1 and 0.3);", "  \\draw[thick] (-1,0) -- (-1,2.6);", "  \\draw[thick] (1,0) -- (1,2.6);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,2.6) ellipse (1 and 0.3);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,0) -- (0,2.6);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.4) {圆柱};", "  % cone", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.2cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) ellipse (1 and 0.3);", "  \\draw[thick] (-1,0) -- (0,2.8);", "  \\draw[thick] (1,0) -- (0,2.8);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,0) -- (0,2.8);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.4) {圆锥};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % pyramid", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.4cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (-1.1,0) -- (0.9,0) -- (1.5,0.55) -- (-0.5,0.55) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thick] (-1.1,0) -- (0.2,2.8);", "  \\draw[thick] (0.9,0) -- (0.2,2.8);", "  \\draw[thick] (1.5,0.55) -- (0.2,2.8);", "  \\draw[dashed] (-0.5,0.55) -- (0.2,2.8);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0.2,-0.4) {棱锥};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % sphere", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=12.8cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,1.3) circle (1.3);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,1.3) ellipse (1.3 and 0.4);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.4) {球};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 本章的立体图形。每种图形的体积都涉及底面积与", "高，唯独球例外，只需要半径。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g9:solids:volumes}", "一个圆柱形罐头的半径为 $4$ cm，高为 $10$ cm：", "\\[", "V = \\pi r^2 h = \\pi \\times 16 \\times 10 = 160\\pi \\approx 503 \\text{ cm}^3", "\\approx 0.5 \\text{ L}.", "\\]", "与之底面、高均相同的圆锥，体积为其三分之一：", "$\\frac{160\\pi}{3} \\approx 168$ cm$^3$。半径为 $4$ cm 的球：", "$V = \\frac43 \\pi \\times 64 = \\frac{256\\pi}{3} \\approx 268$ cm$^3$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[逐步求棱锥的体积]\\label{ex:g9:solids:pyramid}", "一个棱锥的底面是边长为 $6$ m 的正方形，高为 $5$ m。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 底面积：$B = 6^2 = 36$ m$^2$。", "  \\item 体积：$V = \\frac13 \\times 36 \\times 5 = 60$ m$^3$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "注意单位：若边长以 cm 为单位、高以 m 为单位，", "则须先将其中一个量换算成统一的单位。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{平面截立体}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[经典立体图形的截面]\\label{prop:g9:solids:sections}", "用平面截立体图形，所得的平面图形称为它的", "\\emph{截面}\\index{截面}：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 棱柱或圆柱被\\emph{平行于底面}的平面所截，截得", "        的图形与底面全等，且在任意高度处都成立；", "  \\item 棱锥或圆锥被平行于底面的平面所截，截得的图形是", "        底面的\\emph{缩小图形}：在距顶点为 $d$ 处，", "        相似比为 $k = \\frac{d}{h}$；", "  \\item 半径为 $r$ 的球被与球心距离为 $d < r$ 的平面所截，", "        得到的截面是半径为 $\\sqrt{r^2 - d^2}$ 的圆（由", "        勾股定理可得）。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75]", "  % cone with section", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) ellipse (1.5 and 0.45);", "  \\draw[thick] (-1.5,0) -- (0,4.0);", "  \\draw[thick] (1.5,0) -- (0,4.0);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick, fill=omThm!12] (0,2.4) ellipse (0.6 and 0.18);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,0) -- (0,4.0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (0.1,4.0) {顶点};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, thin] (2.1,0) -- (2.1,4.0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (2.1,2.0) {$h$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, thin, omThm] (0.9,2.4) -- (0.9,4.0);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small, omThm] at (0.92,3.2) {$d$};", "  % sphere with section", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,2) circle (1.8);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick, fill=omThm!12] (0,2.9) ellipse (1.56 and 0.4);", "  \\fill (0,2) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\small] {$O$};", "  \\draw[thin] (0,2) -- (0,2.9) node[midway, left, font=\\small] {$d$};", "  \\draw[thin] (0,2.9) -- (1.56,2.9)", "    node[midway, above, font=\\small] {$\\sqrt{r^2 - d^2}$};", "  \\draw[thin] (0,2) -- (-1.27,0.72)", "    node[midway, below right=-3pt, font=\\small] {$r$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}